# M3 model changes E and F (user-approved 2026-10-21) on v3-m3-model-hydration,
# 5000 steps, seed 1111, thirst off (G-ECO-1). Evidence: 0 of 31 earlier
# 5000-step settings kept Cheetah alive; ~95% of Cheetah deaths are
# starvation; Lion kills as many Gazelle as Cheetah. E steers Lion toward
# large prey; F lowers predator food use per step.
axis predation.preySizePreference=0,1,2
axis metabolism.cheetah=0.6,0.8,1.0
axis metabolism.lion=0.8,1.0
